{"id":"1aff2ee432333e82","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-maximal.md","title":"Maximal Element","display":"df-maximal — Maximal Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-maximal","aliases":["58-df-maximal","Maximal","Maximal Element"],"display":"df-maximal — Maximal Element","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-bounding.md]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-maximal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-maximal</span><span>Maximal</span><span>Maximal Element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal — Maximal Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68353af5ed159f6f\" href=\"?note=68353af5ed159f6f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-bounding.md\">../batch07/58-df-bounding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,M,m,x,C,b\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,M,m,x,C,b\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,C\\subseteq P\\land m,x,b\\in P\">\\(M,C\\subseteq P\\land m,x,b\\in P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68353af5ed159f6f\" href=\"?note=68353af5ed159f6f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-bounding.md\">../batch07/58-df-bounding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Maximal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Maximal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (maximal-element predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S,\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S,\\mathrm{Zorn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S,\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S,\\mathrm{Zorn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,M,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(m\\leq_P x\\to x=m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,M,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(m\\leq_P x\\to x=m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}conclusion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}conclusion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn} \\vdash \\mathrm{Zorn}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn} \\vdash \\mathrm{Zorn}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximal: no element strictly larger in the set</li>\n<li>In ZF, the universal closure of <code>Zorn_S</code> over all posets is equivalent to the Axiom of Choice (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a>).</li>\n<li>Ultrafilter lemma: every filter extends to ultrafilter</li>\n<li>Hausdorff maximal principle: every poset has maximal chain</li>\n<li>The order relation and carrier are typed together before any maximality or chain clause is formed; <code>Zorn_S</code> remains the object-level implication for that fixed poset.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-bounding.md","status":"resolved","id":"68353af5ed159f6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-bounding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\leq_P,M,m,x,C,b\\in V$, with $\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, $\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P$, and $\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Chain}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-bounding.md","status":"resolved","id":"68353af5ed159f6f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-bounding.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"In ZF, the universal closure of `Zorn_S` over all posets is equivalent to the Axiom of Choice (see [[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,M,m,x,C,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"M,C\\subseteq P\\land m,x,b\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Maximal}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S,\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S,\\mathrm{Zorn}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,M,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow m\\in M\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(m\\leq_P x\\to x=m)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}hypothesis} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\exists b\\in P\\;\\mathrm{UpperBound}_{P,\\leq_P}(b,C))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}conclusion} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in P\\;\\mathrm{Maximal}_S(m,P,\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}zorn} \\vdash \\mathrm{Zorn}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{ZornHypothesis}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{ZornConclusion}_S(P,\\leq_P))","display":true}],"bytes":2305,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-827","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-maximal.md|58-df-maximal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["83dfbde66bc78255","a07664003abe8d32","68353af5ed159f6f","b3dac4cf78c440c7"]}